## What This Note Is

**The question.** The 19 legacy *$M_2(\mathbb{C})$ Representation* articles are checked against the six live articles: *$M_4(\mathbb{C})$ e-basis Representation*, *$M_4(\mathbb{C})$ e-basis Representation : Operators*, *$M_4(\mathbb{C})$ Standard Peirce Representation*, *$M_4(\mathbb{C})$ Standard Peirce Representation : Operators*, *$M_2(\mathbb{C})$ Standard Peirce Representation*, *$M_2(\mathbb{C})$ Standard Peirce Representation : Operators*. An item is listed only if none of the six states it.

